TRANS_LINEAR, Tween.EASE_IN_OUT) \n    Tween.start()\nI get no errors but when I preview the result, it crashes the editor after about 5-10 seconds.\n\nI've tried changing it from Tween to tween, and checked the documentation for what I should be using but nothing seems to work, giving varying errors from that a . is being treated as a , to \"interpolate property\" does not exist.\n\nIf I attempt to load godot using a cmd, it shows this: \n\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"1709\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55f18893-7026-40a3-a61b-7f92476c692d\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nthis project will crash initially, prior to loading the project, uncomment out var Tween = create_Tween()\n    Tween.interpolate_property(Label, \"visible_ratio\", 0.0, -1.0, len(next_text) * CHAR_READ_RATE, Tween.TRANS_LINEAR, Tween.EASE_IN_OUT) \n    Tween.start()\nthe script will load properly, and then go ahead and uncomment them out, save and the project will crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project32.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21823927/new-game-project32.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api